-- A @recover target read off the visible part of a line with holes: `u`
-- from `P u` beside the hole, wherever the hole stands, and with the
-- context a hole too, and when the view's conclusion splits the context.

view_recover_partial
--------------------

l1: $ nd (hyp a) (P u /\ _wff) $ by all_elim [#1]

view_recover_partial_right
--------------------------

l1: $ nd (hyp a) (_wff /\ Q u) $ by all_elim [#1]

view_recover_partial_ctx
------------------------

l1: $ nd _ctx (P u /\ _wff) $ by all_elim [#1]

view_recover_partial_split
--------------------------

l1: $ nd (hyp a) (P u /\ _wff) $ by all_elim_w [#1]
